            <ArticleTitle>Rectus hematoma- An under-recognized complication of transfemoral cardiac catheterization.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>E128-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a case of rectus hematoma occurring in the setting of transfemoral cardiac catheterization. This is a potentially deadly complication that is under-reported and under-diagnosed. The goal of this article is to present a case of rectus hematoma alongside a comprehensive review of the literature.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
